              "code": "bjlxcss20fsl",
              "name": "Network Services - Magic Transit",
              "new_status": "partial_outage",
              "old_status": "operational"
            }
          ],
          "body": "Cloudflare is currently investigating issues related to Magic Transit. A subset of Magic Transit customers have a Cloudflare-managed setting enabled that clears the Don't Fragment (DF) flag. For these customers, the setting is not currently taking effect. As a result, packets with the DF flag set and larger than the tunnel MTU may be dropped.\nWe advise customers to set an MSS clamp on their egress traffic in order to ensure ingress traffic is correctly sized.",
          "created_at": "2026-11-24T11:29:22.902Z",
          "custom_tweet": null,
          "deliver_notifications": true,
